# Every text file in the repository is stored with LF, and is checked out with
# LF on every platform too. Without this, a Windows clone under
# `core.autocrlf=true` wrote CRLF into the working tree, and the checks that
# measure files in bytes (`check:css-structure`'s per-sheet budgets) measured a
# different file there than on the Linux CI runner.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
